---
// Page 01: boundaries level by level, as a drill-down. Each level opens the provider above it.
---

<figure class="cmodel not-content">
  <div class="scrollx">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 680 366" role="img" aria-label="Level 1: a user, the external boundary, and your system with components A, B and C. Opening your system shows level 2: component A uses component B across an internal boundary, and B holds B1 and B2. Opening B shows level 3, faded: B1 uses B2 across another internal boundary.">
      <text class="m-kb" x="0" y="11">LEVEL 1 · EXTERNAL BOUNDARY</text>
      <rect class="m-box" x="0.5" y="26" width="100" height="58" rx="6"></rect>
      <text class="m-k" x="12" y="43">CONSUMER</text>
      <text class="m-n" x="12" y="66">User</text>
      <circle class="m-person" cx="80" cy="48" r="6"></circle>
      <path class="m-person" d="M69 73 a11 11 0 0 1 22 0"></path>
      <path class="m-line" d="M100.5 55 C118 55 118 44 136 44"></path>
      <path class="m-line" d="M100.5 55 C118 55 118 66 136 66"></path>
      <line class="m-bnd" x1="136" y1="22" x2="136" y2="88"></line>
      <circle class="m-dot" cx="136" cy="44" r="4"></circle>
      <circle class="m-dot" cx="136" cy="66" r="4"></circle>
      <text class="m-k" x="136" y="102" text-anchor="middle">BOUNDARY</text>
      <path class="m-line" d="M140 44 L170 44"></path>
      <path class="m-line" d="M140 66 L170 66"></path>
      <rect class="m-box" x="170" y="20" width="262" height="72" rx="6"></rect>
      <text class="m-k" x="184" y="37">PROVIDER</text>
      <text class="m-n" x="184" y="56">Your system</text>
      <rect class="m-in" x="184" y="64" width="68" height="20" rx="3"></rect><text class="m-c" x="218" y="78">A</text>
      <rect class="m-in" x="260" y="64" width="68" height="20" rx="3"></rect><text class="m-c" x="294" y="78">B</text>
      <rect class="m-in" x="336" y="64" width="68" height="20" rx="3"></rect><text class="m-c" x="370" y="78">C</text>
      <path class="m-zoom" d="M170 92 L196 124"></path>
      <path class="m-zoom" d="M432 92 L626 124"></path>
      <rect class="m-zone" x="196" y="124" width="430" height="114" rx="8"></rect>
      <text class="m-kb" x="210" y="142">LEVEL 2 · INTERNAL BOUNDARY · INSIDE YOUR SYSTEM</text>
      <rect class="m-box" x="210.5" y="156" width="86" height="60" rx="6"></rect>
      <text class="m-k" x="222" y="173">CONSUMER</text>
      <text class="m-n" x="222" y="198">A</text>
      <path class="m-line" d="M296.5 186 C312 186 312 176 326 176"></path>
      <path class="m-line" d="M296.5 186 C312 186 312 196 326 196"></path>
      <line class="m-bnd" x1="326" y1="152" x2="326" y2="222"></line>
      <circle class="m-dot" cx="326" cy="176" r="4"></circle>
      <circle class="m-dot" cx="326" cy="196" r="4"></circle>
      <path class="m-line" d="M330 176 L356 176"></path>
      <path class="m-line" d="M330 196 L356 196"></path>
      <rect class="m-box" x="356" y="152" width="254" height="72" rx="6"></rect>
      <text class="m-k" x="370" y="169">PROVIDER</text>
      <text class="m-n" x="370" y="188">B</text>
      <rect class="m-in" x="370" y="196" width="68" height="20" rx="3"></rect><text class="m-c" x="404" y="210">B1</text>
      <rect class="m-in" x="446" y="196" width="68" height="20" rx="3"></rect><text class="m-c" x="480" y="210">B2</text>
      <path class="m-zoom" d="M356 224 L416 262"></path>
      <path class="m-zoom" d="M610 224 L678 262"></path>
      <g class="m-l3">
        <rect class="m-zone" x="416" y="262" width="262" height="100" rx="8"></rect>
        <text class="m-kb" x="430" y="280">LEVEL 3 · INSIDE B</text>
        <rect class="m-box" x="430.5" y="292" width="66" height="54" rx="6"></rect>
        <text class="m-n" x="442" y="324">B1</text>
        <line class="m-bnd" x1="520" y1="290" x2="520" y2="350"></line>
        <path class="m-line" d="M496.5 320 L550 320"></path>
        <rect class="m-box" x="550" y="290" width="110" height="58" rx="6"></rect>
        <text class="m-n" x="562" y="322">B2</text>
        <text class="m-c" x="640" y="340">…</text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>Each level has the same shape: a consumer, a boundary, a provider. Level 1 boundaries, with the people and systems that use yours, are external. Every boundary below is internal.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .cmodel {
    margin: 26px 0 0;
    padding: 18px 16px 12px;
    border: 1px solid var(--bm-line);
    border-radius: 12px;
  }
  .scrollx {
    overflow-x: auto;
  }
  svg {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    min-width: 520px;
    height: auto;
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: 10px;
    color: var(--bm-fg3);
    font-family: var(--__sl-font-mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
  .m-box {
    fill: var(--bm-bg);
    stroke: var(--bm-fg);
    stroke-width: 1.3;
  }
  .m-in {
    fill: var(--bm-panel);
    stroke: var(--bm-line2);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  .m-line {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--bm-fg4);
    stroke-width: 1;
  }
  .m-bnd {
    stroke: var(--bm-fg);
    stroke-width: 2.5;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }
  .m-dot {
    fill: var(--bm-bg);
    stroke: var(--bm-fg);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }
  .m-zoom {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--bm-line2);
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-dasharray: 3 3;
  }
  .m-zone {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--bm-line2);
    stroke-width: 1;
    stroke-dasharray: 4 4;
  }
  .m-k {
    fill: var(--bm-fg3);
    font-family: var(--__sl-font-mono);
    font-size: 8.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }
  .m-kb {
    fill: var(--bm-fg);
    font-family: var(--__sl-font-mono);
    font-size: 9px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  }
  .m-n {
    fill: var(--bm-fg);
    font-family: var(--__sl-font);
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }
  .m-c {
    fill: var(--bm-fg2);
    font-family: var(--__sl-font-mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    text-anchor: middle;
  }
  .m-person {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--bm-fg);
    stroke-width: 1.3;
  }
  .m-l3 {
    opacity: 0.38;
  }
</style>
